  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "A complete high-backed sauropod reconstruction with an elevated mid-dorsal profile. The skeleton is very incomplete: much of the head, neck, limbs and tail is inferred, and the exact external soft-tissue ridge is unknown.",
    "zh": "完整高背蜥脚类复原，呈现明显抬高的背中部轮廓。骨架很不完整，头颈、四肢和尾的许多部分为推定，体表软组织脊的确切形态未知。"
  },
